<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Carrefour.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Carrefour.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Carrefour, lead manager Citibank S.A said.</p>
<p>    COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   20.MAY.97		 SPOT REF     3800 FRF</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> * * * * * * * * *</p>
<p>TYPE     MATURITY     STRIKE     PRICE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p>CALL C   20.NOV.98    3700 FRF   66.20 FRF 14.79 PCT  5.7 X</p>
<p>CALL D   19.NOV.99    4000 FRF   75.50 FRF 25.13 PCT  5.0 X</p>
<p>    --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
